    "chunk_size_bytes": 839,
    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bcd \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Speaker) Hon. Nizam Kariapper, you just mentioned about economizing on time. I think you should proceed with your speech.\n\nComing back to the matter under discussion today, we are now talking about the economic impact that has come about due to malpractices; this is all about economic impact. But, there is another important matter directly connected to the Sri Lankan economy. I have to speak about it. I am referring to the conflict that may seem distant, but is rapidly becoming a global threat, the war on Iran led by Netanyahu\u2019s Government of Israel. At the heart of this crisis lies the longstanding and heartbreaking situation in Gaza."
  },
