    "chunk_text": "international assistance, I have disagreed with that. My view is that on a crime such as the Easter Sunday attack, where the State is an accused party, the investigation must be international in character. You do not have power over that State structure. The Minister of Justice and National Integration, because his name was registered in Parliament as \"Dr.\", that he had got a PhD, had to go to the CID to make a complaint because he suspected that there was sabotage. That is how deep the political influence has been. We all know that. So, under those circumstances, Sir, mark my words, if you all want genuine justice, you would never get it. You would never get it because you do not have the control of the State in an independent manner. That is the truth.\n\nSo, Sir, an international investigation would be needed into crimes where the accused party is the State itself that even you all have no control over, even if you are genuine like in the case of the Easter Sunday attacks. I can tell you definitely or most certainly that you all are not genuine with regard to the Chemmani mass graves because you all were accomplices; you all wanted the war and supported the war. Your President has said that there would never be a prosecution with regard to those war crimes, only merely a Truth Commission. So, if you want to put right this State, which is broken, then you must do it in a proper way that the victims feel certain that they, at least, have a Government which is listening to them for once and is on their side.\n\nSir, I just want to say one more thing since the Hon. Minister is here.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd6\u0daa \u0db8\u0dcf\u0dad\u0db1\u0dca\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0ba4\u0bb2\u0bb2\u0bb2\u0bc8\u0ba4\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bcd \u0b89\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Presiding Member) \u0d94\u0db6\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0ddc\u0dd4 \u0dc4\u0dc0\u0db1\u0dca \u0dda\u0dc5 \u0dda\u0ddc\u0dbd\u0dba \u0d85\u0dc0\u0dc3\u0ddc\u0db1\u0dba\u0dd2 \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0db1\u0dd2.\n\n333 334\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0da2\u0dd3.\u0da2\u0dd3. \u0dc4\u0dad\u0ddc\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbd\u0db8\u0dca \u0db8\u0dd9\u0dad\u0ddc]\n\n2025 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dd2 09\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0da2\u0dd3.\u0da2\u0dd3. \u0dc0\u0db4\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbd\u0db8\u0dca \u0db8\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dad\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9c\u0bc0.\u0b9c\u0bc0. \u0ba4\u0baa\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0ba9\u0bae\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bb2\u0bae\u0bcd) (The Hon. G.G. Ponnambalam) I will take only one minute, Sir."
  },
