    "chunk_size_bytes": 849,
    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab \u0da2\u0dd3.\u0da2\u0dd3. \u0dc0\u0db4\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbd\u0db8\u0dca \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9c\u0bc0.\u0b9c\u0bc0. \u0ba4\u0baa\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0ba9\u0bae\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bb2\u0bae\u0bcd) (The Hon. G.G. Ponnambalam) Hon. Deputy Chairperson of Committees, today is the 23rd of July. Since 1983, we, the Tamils in particular, have been commemorating this day as the \u201cBlack July\u201d day. The Tamil people outside the North and the East,\n\n845 846\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dd2\u0d9c\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0daf\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0\n\nMadam, this Government that has now come into power makes it a matter of point at every possible opportunity to say that they are not racist like the past governments, especially like the Government in 1983, which did that heinous crime. They say that they do not distinguish on the basis of Sinhala, Tamil, Muslim, Christian and Burgher. Those are the famous phrases that they use."
  },
  {
